{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜日間天晴乾燥　稍後風勢間中清勁\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261031-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】高空反氣旋正為華南帶來大致晴朗的天氣。此外，一股偏東氣流正逐漸影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(10月31日)天氣預測，大致天晴，日間乾燥，最高氣溫約29度。晚上漸轉多雲。吹和緩偏東風，稍後風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望明日大致多雲，初時有一兩陣雨。星期一部分時間有陽光。隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:40.224331+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T23:12:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.798308+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:32.002301+00:00","content_hash":"a25353eadb08d3a2076c3c12ddf78102d35ad2742c534eb49403314532131f10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:40.224331+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}